---
description: Build, test, performance and accessibility gates
alwaysApply: true
---

Before completing any major change, run:

- npm run typecheck
- npm run lint
- npm run test
- npm run build

The portfolio must:
- build from a fresh install
- have no missing imports
- have no console runtime errors
- have reduced-motion support
- have mobile fallback for WebGL-heavy sections
- keep GLB total under 3MB when assets exist
- keep Canvas DPR at [1, 1.5]
- avoid layout shift around the hero
- keep text readable above 4.5:1 contrast where practical
